# Market Compass runs FULLY KEYLESS.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# All core market data is fetched with NO API key:
#   - PSX Data Portal  (via the same-origin /api/psx proxy)
#   - Yahoo Finance     (via the same-origin /api/yahoo crumb proxy — v7 quotes,
#                        v8 charts, v10 statements, v1 search)
# You do NOT need to set anything here to run the app: `npm run dev`.
#
# Optional enhancement — Financial Modeling Prep (FMP)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FMP is an OPTIONAL augmentation only; the app is fully functional without it.
# A real API key is a SECRET and must be server-side only. Do NOT give it a
# VITE_ prefix — anything VITE_-prefixed is bundled into the browser build and
# would leak the key. Provide it as a plain (non-VITE_) server environment
# variable to the serverless runtime instead, e.g.:
#
#   FMP_API_KEY=your_optional_server_side_fmp_key
#
# .gitignore already excludes every .env* file, so a real key is never committed.
